# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies and build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
frontend/dist/
dist-ssr/
*.local


# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Theme material
#
# The ThemeXriver "Consulting" template is licensed to us, not ours
# to redistribute — and it is heavy: 12 MB of reference pages plus
# 8 MB of binary assets, none of which we author or edit.
#
# `scripts/restore-theme-assets.sh` re-downloads everything here, so
# a fresh clone is one command away from running. Do not delete that
# script: without it these ignores would make the repo unbuildable.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
theme-reference/

frontend/public/assets/images/
frontend/public/assets/video/

# NOTE: the two font directories are deliberately NOT ignored. Font
# Awesome's faces are SIL OFL 1.1 and Glyphicons ship under Bootstrap's
# MIT licence, so unlike the template's photography they are ours to
# redistribute — and without them every icon on a deployed build renders
# as an empty box, because the host only ever sees what is committed.

# NOTE: assets/css/ is deliberately NOT ignored. style.css is the design
# system the whole port is built against — text, diffable, and reviewed
# in pull requests like any other source file.

# Full-resolution generated originals (PNGs straight from Nano Banana,
# ~2 MB each). The optimised JPEGs we actually ship are committed, under
# frontend/public/assets/generated/.
assets-source/generated/


# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment and secrets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example


# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs and caches
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.npm/
.cache/
.vite/
coverage/


# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Python (the FastAPI backend)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Recorded contact enquiries. Personal data — never commit these.
backend/enquiries.jsonl
backend/*.jsonl

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/


# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json

# Wrangler local state
.wrangler/
